                            	  1335: ; DMC samples now ship as 14 kHz PCM C arrays in data/audio/sfx_pcm.c
                            	  1336: ; and play through SGDK's XGM Z80 driver. The legacy dmc_samples.inc
                            	  1337: ; include is gone; dmc_trigger trampolines through audio_sfx_play.
