                            	  6208: _L_z05_FindAndCreatePushBlockObject_Found:
                            	  6209:     ; The block was found in a column with an address at
                            	  6210:     ; offset %X in column table. So the column number would
                            	  6211:     ; be (%X/2), and X coordinate ((%X/2)*8). That means
                            	  6212:     ; multiplying %X by 4.
