                            	  2056: _L_z07_DrawItemBySlot_WriteSprites:
                            	  2057:     ; We got here in one of three ways:
                            	  2058:     ;
                            	  2059:     ; A. The item flashes. Attribute value 1 or 2 was chosen
                            	  2060:     ;    explicitly.
                            	  2061:     ; B. The item color varies. ItemSlotToPaletteOffsetsOrValues
                            	  2062:     ;    held an offset that was added to base palette attribute
                            	  2063:     ;    passed in [$04]. This corresponds to class 2 items.
                            	  2064:     ; C. Item doesn't change color. ItemSlotToPaletteOffsetsOrValues
                            	  2065:     ;    held absolute attributes.
                            	  2066:     ;
                            	  2067:     ; At this point, A holds the final sprite attributes.
