                            	  5510:     ;
                            	  5511:     ; If Link catches it some time after throwing it,
                            	  5512:     ; his state will become $20, and he will show the catch animation.
                            	  5513:     ;
                            	  5514:     ; But if he catches it right after throwing it, the state becomes
                            	  5515:     ; $30 ($10 OR $20), which is the end state of using an item.
                            	  5516:     ;
